<title>THAILAND: Thai exchange suspends trade in Alphatec.</title>
<headline>Thai exchange suspends trade in Alphatec.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand said on Monday it suspended trading in shares of Alphatec Electronics Plc pending a release of information by the company.  </p>
<p>The SET said in a statement it was awaiting &quot;some significant information from the company...which may affect the securities price.&quot;</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Alphatec last traded at 20.25 baht on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
